  "authTermsOfService": "Terms of Service",
  "authPrivacyPolicy": "Privacy Policy",
  "authLegalIntro": "By continuing, you agree to our",
  "authLegalAnd": "and",
  "legalTermsBody": "RentalHub Terms of Service\n\n1. What RentalHub is\nRentalHub is a car rental marketplace in Pakistan that connects vehicle owners (shops) with customers. Owners list their vehicles and set their own rates; customers book through the app.\n\n2. Your account\nYou are responsible for keeping your sign-in details safe and for everything done with your account. Give true information about yourself, your shop and your vehicles.\n\n3. Bookings and payments\nBooking prices are set by the vehicle owner. Payments, advances and security deposits follow the terms shown at booking time. A booking can be cancelled under the cancellation terms shown for that booking.\n\n4. Your responsibilities\nOwners must keep their vehicles roadworthy, insured and legally registered, and must honour confirmed bookings. Customers must return vehicles on time, in the condition received, and pay any agreed extra charges for damage, late return or extra kilometres.\n\n5. Prohibited use\nDo not use RentalHub for anything unlawful, do not list a vehicle you do not have the right to rent out, and do not share another person's personal information without their permission.\n\n6. Liability\nRentalHub provides the marketplace and the booking tools. Owners and customers are responsible for their own vehicles, driving and agreements with each other. To the extent allowed by law, RentalHub is not liable for loss or damage arising from a rental between an owner and a customer.\n\n7. Changes and contact\nWe may update these terms and will show the current version in the app. Questions: contact RentalHub support from the Help section in the app.",
  "legalPrivacyBody": "RentalHub Privacy Policy\n\n1. What we collect\nWe collect the information you give us: your name, phone number, email address, CNIC details and documents, shop details, vehicle details and photos, booking and payment records, and messages you send through the app. We also collect basic technical information such as device type and app usage needed to run the service.\n\n2. How we use it\nWe use your information to run RentalHub: to create and verify accounts, list vehicles, process bookings and payments, prevent fraud and blacklisted rentals, and to contact you about your bookings and your shop.\n\n3. How we share it\nWe share your information only as needed to run the service: with the other party to your booking (owner or customer), with payment providers to process payments, and with the authorities when the law requires it. We do not sell your personal information.\n\n4. Photos and documents\nCNIC photos, selfies, licences and shop photos are used only for verification and for the rental record. They are not used for face matching and are not shared publicly.\n\n5. How long we keep it\nWe keep your information while your account is active and for as long as needed for bookings, payments, disputes and legal records. You can ask us to delete your account and its personal information from the Help section, subject to records we must keep by law.\n\n6. Your choices\nYou can update your profile and shop details in the app, and you can turn app notifications on or off in Settings.\n\n7. Contact\nQuestions about your data: contact RentalHub support from the Help section in the app.",
